OL,3,GNEWSA'If we had genetic testing, my
OL,4,Asister's life could have been saved'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparing for her "once in a lifetime"
OL,7,Fhoneymoon in 2017, Katie McSweeney sat
OL,8,Fin a nurse's office ready to receive
OL,9,Fher travel vaccinations.
OL,11,FDespite otherwise feeling well, the
OL,12,F29-year-old mentioned having an
OL,13,F"uncomfortable stomach" and going to
OL,14,Fthe toilet a lot, though said she had
OL,15,Fput that down to wedding nerves and
OL,16,Fwork stress.
OL,18,FHowever, after some encouragement from
OL,19,Fthe nurse, she went to see her GP for
OL,20,Ftests.
