OL,3,GNEWSA'If we had genetic testing, my
OL,4,Asister's life could have been saved'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen days before her wedding she was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with stage three bowel cancer
OL,8,F- then, months later, her older sister
OL,9,Freceived the same diagnosis.
